{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the total number of carriages, we first need to determine the total length of the train. The train takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds to fully pass the level crossing. Converting this duration entirely into seconds gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/950a55763933370f7b95a51f6d0b1cf40419667b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 60 + 40 = 160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" /> seconds. Since the train travels at a constant speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> meters per second, we multiply the time by the speed to find that the total length of the train is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c619ea5228fc2dca8036f346ecd79d5ecb04ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$160 \\times 5 = 800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> meters. Each individual carriage, including the locomotive, has a length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0aca084b717ca0355a18189d9ae818743c9b682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> meters. Dividing the total length of the train by the length of one carriage gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/cea862c92af63063021ffe174693060621f5bbdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{800}{12.5} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" /> carriages in total.\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d441ac5e7359e107acc3172c7a277feb996ddb24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1456/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37394:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034430 and revision id 291908. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}